s match run start to under 0.1 mm. base1 drifted 0.002 m, and the placement frames moved with it.\n- Inactive task parts: per-span monitors. Later place steps named the already-seated parts in object_ids as mating parts, and they drifted at most 0.003 m.\n\nWorkspace: I compared a baseline and a final RGB look. Observation obs-001 records an unidentified small orange-red object visible only in the final look. No requirement is affected, because every registered object stayed within bounds.\n\nThe executor's claim of completed agrees with this independent measurement.","run_scope":true,"executor_terminal_status":"completed","findings_during_run":[],"recovered":false},"subscriber_count":2,"seq":43}
